The Veros VeroVALUE AVM is an 
ensemble-based valuation platform that integrates 
hedonic pricing models, statistical index models, and machine learning techniques to
estimate residential property values. It leverages extensive property transaction,
MLS, and market datasets to generate valuation estimates, while confidence scores and 
forecast standard deviation metrics quantify valuation uncertainty. 
From a model risk management perspective, 
the framework demonstrates robust governance through continuous validation, 
data quality controls, performance monitoring, and ongoing model oversight.

